      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"MrLeRobot\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mrlerobot/48/1932_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MrLeRobot:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>So according to <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/content/oversized-cards-and-promos-and-panels\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">this</a>&nbsp;image, Jim took his hat off  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=12\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> &nbsp;and Writhe took his hat off  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=12\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> …Also, I can't believe they convinced Mainstay to put this outfit on!&nbsp; <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grin.png?v=12\" title=\":grin:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grin:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> What's happening to the mulvitverse!?!&nbsp; <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=12\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I felt the same way upon seeing Mainstay's outfit. Although it is obvious that he is wearing it because the Idealist came up with it and he just wants to make her happy.</p>",
